{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>發佈時間：09:15 2026-10-06 HKT</p>\n\n<p>大埔大景街海濱公園對開位置，今（6日）早上7時30分，有途人發現有一具人形物體在海中載浮載沉，報警求助，消防到場將一名男子救起，惟證實已當場不治。現場消息稱，事主年約20多歲，正調查其身份。</p>\n<img alt=\"墮海男子當場不治。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a6228bee300a64e061c97917c15cc9c1/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-06_at_09_07_50_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"警員到場調查。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5ab323667d4977bd1ac33a7ddd02b502/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-06_at_09_07_52.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/328fdb3fd13735ff84ea3d3cc2fbb75a/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-06_at_09_07_51_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"警員到場調查。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/55e9854110e32ac8ab6a2affdf974621/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-06_at_09_07_51_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/65babf6aeaf64a6c4c7d5e81e123a736/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-06_at_09_07_50.jpeg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-06T01:39:49.050251+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":5,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}